{"id":"msg_m_ex_rewind_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_rewind","label":"Rewind · Group"},"label":"1. Coach! Coach!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_rewind_02","speakers":{"clay":"Clay","bay":"Bay"},"icons":{"clay":"si_c551_00_s","bay":"si_c550_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_1","text":"Coach! Coach!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_2","text":"What is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_3","text":"We have a question.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_4","text":"When you see a glass that's filled half-way with water,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_5","text":"what would you call it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_6","text":"A glass that's half full.","jump":"m_ex_rewind_01_9"},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_7","text":"A glass that's half empty.","jump":"m_ex_rewind_01_13"},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_8","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_8","text":"A glass with water in it.","jump":"m_ex_rewind_01_17"},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_9","text":"Whoa!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_10","text":"I knew that's how you'd think!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_11","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_12","text":"My thoughts exactly!","jump":"m_ex_rewind_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_13","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_14","text":"That's a fair answer,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_15","text":"but don't you think it makes you feel a bit...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_16","text":"disappointed?","jump":"m_ex_rewind_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_17","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_18","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_19","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_20","text":"What a unique answer!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_21","text":"I never thought of that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_22","text":"I suppose if you think about it rationally,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_23","text":"that's a perfectly valid response.","jump":"m_ex_rewind_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_24","text":"Why are you asking that all of a sudden?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_25","text":"Bay and I were looking at a cup","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_26","text":"filled with water,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_27","text":"and it got us thinking about how everyone might perceive it differently.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_28","text":"Turns out,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_29","text":"Bay and I have entirely different opinions on it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_30","text":"Isn't that fascinating?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_31","text":"I think the glass is half full.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_32","text":"But I think","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_33","text":"it's half empty.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_34","text":"We were curious what you would think,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_35","text":"but now we know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_36","text":"Then what do you think when you see a glass that's completely full?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_37","text":"I think... that's a whole lotta water, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_38","text":"A full glass looks really nice, don't you think?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_39","text":"Personally,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_40","text":"it makes me feel a bit uneasy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_41","text":"It looks like it could spill at any moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_42","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_43","text":"What about you, Coach?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_44","text":"I'd just think about how much I want to drink it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_45","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_46","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_47","text":"Why do you say so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_48","text":"I'm parched at the moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_49","text":"!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_50","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_51","text":"I guess we kept you for too long T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"clay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_52","text":"Hurry and get some water to drink!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_53","text":"We've got to get back to practice anyway.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_rewind_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"bay","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_rewind_01_54","text":"See you later.","jump":null}],"chat":true}